  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Bug Fixes:\n- resume without a token when no matching checkpoint exists\n  Allow applications adopting OM to attach and resume subscriptions when only a legacy namespace-only checkpoint exists. Pass no token until a checkpoint matches the provider and full stream identity, then use that checkpoint on later attachments.\n  Preserve exact source matching and the tracked-resume opt-out. Update migration and API guidance, remove the unused legacy-checkpoint guard, and cover explicit and implicit fallback, subsequent tracked resume, and mismatched sources.",
